# Build output
# ============
#
# The Makefile puts every object in obj/ and the core beside the sources, so
# both end up in the working copy the moment anybody runs make. None of it
# belongs in the repository: it is rebuilt from the sources by CI on every push,
# and a committed DLL is a binary nobody can review and everybody's diff has to
# carry.
obj/
*.o
*.d
*.dll
*.exe

# What the workflow assembles before uploading, and what a local packaging run
# leaves behind.
dist/
build/
*.zip

# Working files, not part of the core.
_to_delete/
*.log
